                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump isn\u2019t just shuttering the government to raise health care costs; he\u2019s withholding billions in critical funding for Hudson Tunnel and Second Ave. subway projects to punish NYC.\n\nThis isn't budget work. It's a ruthless plot to hold the nation\u2019s largest city hostage. Trump must immediately unfreeze these crucial funds.",
