                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The shutdown is just one front in Trump's war on Americans.\u00a0\n\nWhile the GOP holds paychecks hostage to gut health care, Trump is freezing vital NYC transit funding out of pure spite. It's a simple extortion effort to try to inflict pain and punish opponents. Stop trying to extort Democrats and come back to DC to open the government.",
