                "retweet_count": 377,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We are now entering the 3rd week of the Trump Shutdown, which is only happening because Republicans insist on taking health care away from millions of Americans.\u00a0\n\nThey refuse to negotiate with Democrats even though they need Democratic votes \u2014 and are intent on taking health care away from 4 million Americans and doubling premiums for 20 millions more.\u00a0\n\nDemocrats won't let them put billionaires over your family.",
