                "retweet_count": 97,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Two weeks into the GOP\u2019s government shutdown, my Democratic colleagues and I are in DC and ready to work for the American people and make health care affordable.\n\nRepublicans are nowhere to be found.\n\nDemocrats will continue to be ready, willing and able to open the government while Republicans just don\u2019t care.",
