                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Community health centers are the bedrock of our health care system in underserved communities, and their mandate is to serve every New Yorker, regardless of income or insurance.\n\nYesterday, I visited @RyanHealthNYC to meet with a number of community health center leaders to discuss how the GOP\u2019s shutdown and cuts in the Big Ugly Bill have the potential to devastate affordable care for New Yorkers.\n\nWe must protect them.",
