                "retweet_count": 1423,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Beginning Nov 1, Trump announced he will cut off food assistance for 3m New Yorkers.  \n\nHe\u2019s starving our communities all to punish Democrats for protecting affordable health care.  \n\nI joined my colleagues from across NYC to condemn this unacceptable assault on our working families.",
