                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This #AmericanDiabetesMonth, we honor all impacted by diabetes. I'm fighting to end the shutdown and secure health care funding that keeps care affordable. We must prevent premium spikes and fully fund research to protect families with chronic conditions.\n\u00a0\nLet's support the @AmDiabetesAssn as they work to prevent, manage, and cure this disease.",
