                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump\u2019s shutdown has pushed our air traffic system to the brink. Half of all major airports are understaffed. Flights are delayed. Controllers are working unpaid double shifts.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nThe GOP would rather ground our planes than make health care affordable for millions of Americans.",
