                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 163,
                "retweet_count": 91,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump is making history for all the wrong reasons. 37 days into the longest shutdown ever, millions of Americans are being punished for his political games.\n\nFederal workers are going unpaid. Food stamps are frozen. Health care subsidies are about to expire.\n\nThis is government by chaos and cruelty, and it must end.",
