                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 349,
                "retweet_count": 212,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If Republicans want Democrats to support a budget bill, then they must negotiate with Democrats to get that support. \n\nThat means that Senate Democrats must hold the line to save health care for 24 million Americans, not trade that away for an empty promise. \n\nI\u2019m a NO on this shutdown deal and urge Senate Democrats to vote no, as well.\n\nMy full statement:",
