                "retweet_count": 31,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The GOP health care cuts will rip care away from 15 million Americans and destabilize hospitals that serve Black, Hispanic, and immigrant communities.\n\u00a0\nClinics will close and costs will rise, all so Republicans can hand out tax cuts to the rich.",
