                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The @CDCgov is our government\u2019s definitive medical agency responsible for safeguarding the nation\u2019s health.\n\n@SecKennedy is reneging on his confirmation promises by using it to launder conspiracy theories.\n\nBy promoting false claims linking vaccines to autism, Kennedy is endangering lives and destroying the CDC\u2019s credibility.",
