                "text": "On December 31, millions of Americans will lose health care coverage because Republicans refuse to extend essential subsidies for everyday Americans to get health care.\n\nClinics will close, costs will rise, and everybody will continue to suffer under the Republican Health Care Crisis.\n\nThe GOP is still treating people\u2019s health like a political pawn.",
